    <briefdescription>
<para>Analytical term-structure fitting parameter <formula id="294">$ \varphi(t) $</formula>. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><formula id="294">$ \varphi(t) $</formula> is analytically defined by <formula id="306">\[ \varphi(t) = f(t) + \frac{1}{2}[\frac{\sigma(1-e^{-at})}{a}]^2, \]</formula> where <formula id="302">$ f(t) $</formula> is the instantaneous forward rate at <formula id="147">$ t $</formula>. </para>    </detaileddescription>
